+	// connection attempt that the pod's egress filter has to evaluate and log,
+	// and the whole point of -isnotfc is that this envd is not in a microVM.
+	//
+	// The two values it would fetch (E2B_SANDBOX_ID, E2B_TEMPLATE_ID) are
